  "description": "Lightweight, extremely fast and memory efficient Excel (.xlsx) writer for .NET.\n      Multi-targets .NET Standard 2.1 (.NET Core 3.1, .NET 5+) and .NET 10.\n      Streams data directly to file with no memory footprint.\n      Supports multiple sheets, auto sheet split, styles, freeze panes,\n      RTL, auto column width, merge cells, formulas, and number formats.",
