  "releaseNotes": "v2.3.1 — Multi-targeting + worksheet order fix.\n      - Now targets netstandard2.1 (.NET Core 3.1, .NET 5+) and net10.0\n      - DateOnly/TimeOnly support is compiled only on .NET 6+ targets\n      - Fixed invalid OOXML element order (sheetViews now precedes cols) that\n        caused Excel to prompt for recovery when using ColumnsWidth with\n        freeze panes / RTL\n      - No public API changes; net10.0 build is unchanged",
